{"id":"reference/Assembly","kind":"langref","title":"汇编","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#Assembly","file":"reference/Assembly.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"Assembly","text":"汇编"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Output-Constraints","text":"输出约束"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Input-Constraints","text":"输入约束"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Clobbers","text":"破坏声明"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Global-Assembly","text":"全局汇编"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"Assembly\" class=\"chapter-anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Assembly/#Assembly\">汇编</a></h2>\n\n      <p>某些场景需要直接控制 Zig 程序生成的机器码，而不能依赖 Zig 的代码生成。此时可以使用内联汇编。以下示例在 x86_64 Linux 上使用内联汇编实现 Hello, World：</p>\n      <div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">inline_assembly.zig</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"zig\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">pub</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">fn</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">main</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">noreturn</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">msg</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"hello world</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">_</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">syscall3</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">SYS_write</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">STDOUT_FILENO</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">@intFromPtr</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">msg</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">msg</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">len</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">_</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">syscall1</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">SYS_exit</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">unreachable</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">pub</span><span sty